      "body": "## Summary\n- Expand the existing unsupported-toolchain troubleshooting section with the PTX JIT / missing native cubin failure mode.\n- Add concrete remediation guidance: update the driver, rebuild vLLM with a compatible CUDA toolkit, or switch attention backend when the failure is isolated to an attention kernel.\n\nRefs #47397\n\n## Duplicate / overlap check\n- #38669 and #36579 address specific Marlin runtime/code paths.\n- This PR is docs-only and updates the general troubleshooting page rather than changing those kernel paths.\n\n## Test Plan\n- `git diff --check`\n- `pre-commit run markdownlint-cli2 --files docs/usage/troubleshooting.md`\n- Local doc assertions for the PTX JIT, native cubin, and attention-backend guidance",
